{%- comment -%}
  VetPets Welcome Popup A/B test (vp_popup_ab) - config + deferred loader for assets/vp-popup-ab.js.
  Rendered before </body> in every storefront layout (theme, the two prelander layouts and
  theme.gempages.blank); prelander/GemPages layouts pass lander: true.

  Assignment: on the first page view, Math.random() < 0.5 -> "A" else "B", stored in the
  first-party cookie vp_popup_ab (90 days from assignment) and localStorage vp_popup_ab
  (+ vp_popup_ab_ts, the assignment time, so a cleared cookie is restored for the same
  90 days). Never re-assigned inside that window. popup_ab_assigned {variant} fires once,
  at assignment.

  A (control): unchanged - the popup only where the theme already renders it, the home page
    (sections/vetpets-popup.liquid placed in templates/index.json).
  B: the same popup on every page except cart, checkout, account and thank-you (below:
    vpab_ex). Off the home page it is the home page's own rendered section, fetched after
    window load at idle (once per tab session, cached in sessionStorage) and injected, so
    offer, design, code SCRATCH5 and the vetpets_welcome_popup closed/signed-up suppression
    are identical. Nothing is fetched while suppressed.
    PDPs and offer pages (vpab_slow): opens at 8 s after navigation start or at 40% scroll,
    whichever comes first. Every other B page uses the section's own trigger setting.

  Measurement: the section's events carry variant (and qa: true under the override) and go
  to Klaviyo, dataLayer (GTM) and Shopify.analytics.publish (custom pixels). On email
  submit the Klaviyo profile gets popup_ab_variant. Cart attribute popup_ab_variant is
  written whenever the cart lacks the visitor's arm, so orders split by arm.

  QA: ?vp_popup_ab=A or ?vp_popup_ab=B forces that arm for the tab session (sessionStorage,
  real assignment untouched); ?vp_popup_ab=clear ends it.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign vpab_ex = false
  assign vpab_segs = request.path | downcase | split: '/'
  if request.design_mode or request.page_type == 'cart' or request.page_type == 'password' or request.page_type contains 'customers/'
    assign vpab_ex = true
  elsif vpab_segs contains 'cart' or vpab_segs contains 'checkout' or vpab_segs contains 'checkouts' or vpab_segs contains 'account' or vpab_segs contains 'orders' or vpab_segs contains 'thank_you' or vpab_segs contains 'thank-you'
    assign vpab_ex = true
  endif

  assign vpab_slow = false
  if lander or request.page_type == 'product'
    assign vpab_slow = true
  elsif request.page_type == 'page'
    assign vpab_suffix = template.suffix | default: '' | downcase
    if vpab_suffix contains 'offer' or vpab_suffix contains 'lander' or vpab_suffix contains 'landing' or vpab_suffix contains 'quiz' or vpab_suffix contains 'gp-template'
      assign vpab_slow = true
    endif
  endif
-%}
<script type="application/json" id="vp-popup-ab-config">{"ex":{{ vpab_ex | json }},"slow":{{ vpab_slow | json }},"cart":{{ cart.attributes.popup_ab_variant | default: '' | json }},"root":{{ routes.root_url | json }},"cartUpdate":{{ routes.cart_update_url | json }}}</script>
<script src="{{ 'vp-popup-ab.js' | asset_url }}" defer></script>
